WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:05.084
How long do requests to / take?

2
00:00:05.084 --> 00:00:07.468
An average hides the slow ones.

3
00:00:07.468 --> 00:00:11.083
So teams ask for a percentile, such as the p95.

4
00:00:11.333 --> 00:00:19.446
A p95 of 200 milliseconds means 95% of requests took 200 milliseconds or less.

5
00:00:19.599 --> 00:00:23.933
In PromQL, the p95 for hello-devops is this one line.

6
00:00:23.933 --> 00:00:25.159
It looks scary.

7
00:00:25.159 --> 00:00:27.449
Read it from the inside out.
